The Lodger is a horror, mystery, thriller film directed by David Ondaatje.

3
00:17:48,750 --> 00:17:54,750
Follows a seasoned detective on the trail of a ruthless killer intent on
slaughtering prostitutes along West Hollywood's Sunset Strip.

4
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:51,000
It appears that the murderer's grisly methods are identical to that of London's infamous 19th century
psychopath Jack the Ripper – a relentless serial killer who was never caught by police.

5
00:29:41,250 --> 00:29:47,250
To make matters worse, the detective soon notices the parallels between the crimes committed by
the West Hollywood stalker and those of a serial murderer incarcerated years ago.

6
