01:17:11,250 --> 01:17:17,250
The Lodger is a 2009 mystery/thriller film directed by David Ondaatje
and starring Alfred Molina, Hope Davis and Simon Baker.

14
01:23:07,500 --> 01:23:13,500
It is based on the 1913 novel The Lodger by Marie Belloc Lowndes, filmed previously by Alfred Hitchcock in 1927, by
Maurice Elvey in 1932, by John Brahm in 1944, and as Man in the Attic (1953) directed by Hugo Fregonese.

